<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>SeedWool 盛鼎岩棉 — 中国水稻育秧岩棉技术标准与数据平台</title>
<meta name="description" content="SeedWool 盛鼎岩棉：中国水稻育秧岩棉技术标准与数据平台。中国农科院 & 中国水稻研究所技术背书。让每一株秧苗，都有数据可依。">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
--basalt:#1E2730;--moss:#3D9970;--moss-light:#4FC38A;--sand:#E8DCC8;--sand-dark:#D4C4B0;
--ink:#FFFFFF;--ink-muted:#B8C5D0;--ink-dark:#1A222A;--card:#26313D;--border:#354452;
--radius:12px;--radius-sm:8px;--shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
--maxw:1200px;--transition:0.3s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:'Noto Sans SC','Inter',system-ui,sans-serif;background:var(--basalt);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.7;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
img{max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
.container{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);font-weight:600;font-size:15px;transition:var(--transition);border:none;cursor:pointer}
.btn-primary{background:var(--moss);color:#fff}
.btn-primary:hover{background:var(--moss-light);transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(61,153,112,0.4)}
.btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--border)}
.btn-ghost:hover{background:var(--card);border-color:var(--moss)}
.badge{display:inline-block;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;background:rgba(61,153,112,0.15);color:var(--moss-light)}
.section{padding:100px 0}
.section-alt{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--basalt),var(--card))}
.section-title{font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,42px);font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:16px}
.section-sub{font-size:18px;color:var(--ink-muted);max-width:700px}
.grid{display:grid;gap:24px}
.grid-3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
.grid-2{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:32px;transition:var(--transition)}
.card:hover{border-color:var(--moss);transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.card-icon{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(61,153,112,0.15);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:16px}
.card-icon svg{width:24px;height:24px;stroke:var(--moss-light)}
.stat{text-align:center}
.stat-value{font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,56px);font-weight:700;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--moss-light),var(--sand));-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text;line-height:1}
.stat-label{font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-top:4px}
.header{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(30,39,48,0.9);backdrop-filter:blur(20px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.header-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:72px}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:700;font-size:20px}
.logo-mark{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--moss),var(--moss-light));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.logo-mark svg{width:20px;height:20px;stroke:#fff}
.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:32px}
.nav-link{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink-muted);transition:var(--transition);position:relative}
.nav-link:hover,.nav-link.active{color:var(--moss-light)}
.nav-link.active::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:-6px;left:0;right:0;height:2px;background:var(--moss);border-radius:2px}
.lang-toggle{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);font-size:13px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer}
.lang-toggle:hover{border-color:var(--moss)}
.hero{min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding-top:72px}
.hero-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 20%,rgba(61,153,112,0.08),transparent),radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 80%,rgba(232,220,200,0.05),transparent);pointer-events:none}
.hero-content{position:relative;z-index:1}
.hero-badge{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:24px;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(61,153,112,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(61,153,112,0.2);font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--moss-light)}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,56px);font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:24px;max-width:900px}
.hero h1 span{color:var(--moss-light)}
.hero p{font-size:clamp(18px,2.5vw,22px);color:var(--ink-muted);max-width:700px;margin-bottom:32px;line-height:1.7}
.hero-cta{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.trust-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:40px;padding:32px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin-top:60px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.trust-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-muted)}
.trust-item svg{width:20px;height:20px;stroke:var(--moss)}
.stats-bar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:24px;padding:60px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.stats-bar{display:none}

/* 产品中心 */
.product-library{padding:100px 0}
.product-filters{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:32px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.filter-btn{padding:10px 20px;border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--ink-muted);font-size:14px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;transition:var(--transition)}
.filter-btn:hover,.filter-btn.active{border-color:var(--moss);color:var(--moss-light);background:rgba(61,153,112,0.1)}
.product-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:24px}
.product-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;transition:var(--transition)}
.product-card:hover{border-color:var(--moss);transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.product-image{height:200px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--basalt),var(--card));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;position:relative}
.product-image .placeholder{color:var(--border);font-size:14px}
.product-info{padding:24px}
.product-category{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--moss-light);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;margin-bottom:8px}
.product-name{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.4}
.product-specs{display:flex;gap:16px;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-muted);flex-wrap:wrap}
.product-spec{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.product-price{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.price-range{font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:var(--moss-light)}
.moq{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-muted)}
.product-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:16px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}

/* 阿里国际站板块 */
.alibaba-store{padding:100px 0;background:var(--card)}
.alibaba-intro{text-align:center;margin-bottom:40px}
.alibaba-intro h3{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--moss-light);margin-bottom:10px}
.alibaba-intro p{font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-bottom:24px}
.alibaba-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px}
.alibaba-card{background:var(--basalt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:22px 20px;transition:transform 0.2s,border-color 0.2s;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.alibaba-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:var(--moss)}
.alibaba-img{width:100%;height:140px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--basalt),var(--card));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--border);font-size:13px;margin-bottom:14px}
.alibaba-card h4{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.5}
.alibaba-card .price{font-size:15px;color:var(--moss-light);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:8px}
.alibaba-card .moq{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-bottom:10px}
.alibaba-card .specs{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.5}
.alibaba-card .btn-alibaba{margin-top:auto;display:inline-block;padding:8px 16px;background:var(--moss);color:#fff;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}
.alibaba-card .btn-alibaba:hover{background:var(--moss-light)}
.alibaba-cta{text-align:center;margin-top:40px}

/* 标准与证书 */
.section-standards{padding:80px 0}
.std-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px;align-items:start}
.std-text h3{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:var(--moss-light);margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.5}
.std-text p{font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.7}
.cert-row{display:flex;gap:16px;margin-top:26px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.cert-item{flex:1;min-width:150px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;text-align:center;background:var(--basalt);cursor:pointer}
.cert-item:hover{border-color:var(--moss)}
.cert-item img{width:100%;height:110px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:8px;opacity:0.85;background:#1a222a}
.cert-item:hover img{opacity:1}
.cert-item p{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-top:6px}
.cert-item .tag{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--moss-light);font-weight:700;margin-top:4px}

/* 数据看板 */
.section-data{padding:80px 0;background:var(--card)}
.data-intro{text-align:center;margin-bottom:40px}
.data-intro h3{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--moss-light);margin-bottom:10px}
.data-intro p{font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-bottom:6px}
.data-intro .note{font-size:12px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:10px}
.charts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:24px;margin-bottom:24px}
.chart-card{background:var(--basalt);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;height:240px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.chart-card h4{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:16px}
.chart-placeholder{flex:1;border:1px dashed var(--border);border-radius:10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--ink-muted);font-size:13px;background:#1a222a}
.chart-placeholder .bar{width:34%;height:110px;background:var(--moss);border-radius:4px 4px 0 0;margin-bottom:10px}
.badge-row{display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:24px}
.badge{padding:10px 18px;border-radius:24px;background:rgba(61,153,112,0.15);color:var(--moss-light);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;border:1px solid rgba(61,153,112,0.3)}
.cta-data{text-align:center}

/* 合作伙伴 */
.section-partners{padding:80px 0}
.partners h3{text-align:center;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--moss-light);margin-bottom:10px}
.partners p{text-align:center;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-bottom:36px;font-size:15px}
.logo-wall{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:40px;flex-wrap:wrap;opacity:0.55}
.logo-item{height:48px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;filter:grayscale(100%);transition:filter 0.3s}
.logo-item:hover{filter:grayscale(0%);opacity:1}
.logo-item .box{width:120px;height:60px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#1a222a}
.logo-item .box img{max-width:100%;max-height:100%;object-fit:contain}

/* CTA */
.section-cta{padding:80px 0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--moss),var(--moss-light));color:#fff;text-align:center}
.section-cta h2{font-size:30px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:14px}
.section-cta p{font-size:16px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);margin-bottom:26px;line-height:1.7;max-width:700px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
.section-cta .cta-group{display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:26px}
.section-cta .contact{font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);margin-top:14px}
.section-cta .contact .tel{font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-left:6px}

/* 批次验真弹窗 */
.modal{display:none;position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;background:rgba(15,23,42,0.55);z-index:1000;backdrop-filter:blur(4px)}
.modal.open{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.modal-content{background:var(--card);border-radius:16px;width:90%;max-width:560px;max-height:85vh;overflow-y:auto;padding:32px;position:relative;animation:fadeIn 0.25s}
@keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-12px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
.modal-close{position:absolute;top:16px;right:20px;font-size:24px;color:var(--ink-muted);cursor:pointer}
.modal h3{font-size:20px;color:var(--moss-light);margin-bottom:20px}
.verify-form{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:24px}
.verify-form input[type="text"]{flex:1;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;background:var(--basalt);color:var(--ink)}
.verify-result{margin-top:24px;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;display:none}
.verify-result.ok{background:rgba(61,153,112,0.1);border:1px solid var(--moss);color:var(--moss-light)}
.verify-result .label{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:8px}
.verify-result .val{font-size:16px;font-weight:800}
.verify-result .small{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-top:8px}

/* 符合性判定 */
.compliance-demo{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:30px 26px;max-width:700px;margin:0 auto}
.compliance-demo h4{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:var(--moss-light);margin-bottom:22px}
.compliance-demo .form-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(110px,1fr));gap:14px;margin-bottom:26px}
.compliance-demo .field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
.compliance-demo .field label{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink-muted)}
.compliance-demo .field input{padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;background:var(--basalt);color:var(--ink)}
.compliance-demo .field .unit{font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:2px}
.compliance-demo .btn-check{width:100%;padding:12px;background:var(--moss);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
.compliance-result{margin-top:26px;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;display:none;text-align:center}
.compliance-result.A{background:rgba(61,153,112,0.1);border:1px solid var(--moss);color:var(--moss-light)}
.compliance-result .grade{font-size:34px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:4px;margin-bottom:8px}
.compliance-result .desc{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px}
.compliance-result .items{text-align:left;display:inline-block;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--ink-muted);margin-top:10px}

.footer{background:var(--ink-dark);padding:60px 0 32px}
.footer-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr repeat(3,1fr);gap:40px;margin-bottom:48px}
.footer-brand p{color:var(--ink-muted);margin-top:16px;max-width:300px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}
.footer-title{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--sand);margin-bottom:16px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em}
.footer-links{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.footer-link{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-muted);transition:var(--transition)}
.footer-link:hover{color:var(--moss-light)}
.footer-bottom{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-muted);flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px}
.footer-bottom a{color:var(--ink-muted);transition:var(--transition)}
.footer-bottom a:hover{color:var(--moss-light)}
@media(max-width:900px){
.grid-3,.grid-2,.std-grid,.charts,.alibaba-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.nav{display:none}
.stats-bar{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
.footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
.product-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(280px,1fr))}
.hero .container{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
@media(max-width:600px){
.section{padding:70px 0}
.stats-bar{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.footer-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.hero-cta{flex-direction:column}
.hero-cta .btn{width:100%}
.product-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="header">
<div class="container header-inner">
<a href="#" class="logo">
<div class="logo-mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v20M12 2l-6 6M12 2l6 6M5 14l7 7 7-7"/></svg></div>
<span>SeedWool™ 盛鼎岩棉</span>
</a>
<nav class="nav">
<a href="#why">为什么岩棉育秧</a>
<a href="#products">产品中心</a>
<a href="#standards">标准与证书</a>
<a href="#data">数据看板</a>
<a href="#partners">合作背书</a>
<a href="#contact">联系我们</a>
</nav>
<div class="nav-actions" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px">
<span class="lang" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-muted)">中文</span>
<button class="btn-primary" onclick="openVerifyModal()">批次号验真</button>
</div>
</div>
</header>

<!-- Section 1: 业务组合（第1位） -->
<section class="section section-alt" id="portfolio" style="padding:80px 0">
<div class="container">
<div style="text-align:center;max-width:800px;margin:0 auto 60px">
<h2 class="section-title">业务组合</h2>
<p class="section-sub">以岩棉为基底，覆盖五大业务：增长极引领，现金牛支撑，协同线互补，长线布局，收缩聚焦。</p>
</div>
<div class="grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px">
<article class="card" style="border-color:var(--moss);position:relative">
<div style="position:absolute;top:16px;right:16px;font-size:20px">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>
<h3 style="color:var(--moss-light);margin-bottom:8px">增长极</h3>
<h4 style="font-size:22px;margin-bottom:16px">水稻育秧基质</h4>
<p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-muted);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:16px">SeedWool 水稻育秧岩棉核心产品，对标 NY/T 2118 标准，以数据平台驱动工艺迭代。</p>
<div style="margin-top:20px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-muted)">核心增长极</div>
</article>
<article class="card">
<h3 style="color:var(--sand);margin-bottom:8px">现金牛</h3>
<h4 style="font-size:22px;margin-bottom:16px">建筑保温</h4>
<p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-muted);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:16px">建筑外墙、屋面、防火隔离带岩棉板，稳定现金流支撑农业业务投入。</p>
</article>
<article class="card">
<h3 style="color:var(--sand);margin-bottom:8px">协同</h3>
<h4 style="font-size:22px;margin-bottom:16px">蔬果育苗</h4>
<p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-muted);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:16px">蔬菜、瓜果育苗岩棉基质，与水稻育秧技术协同，共享产线与渠道。</p>
</article>
<article class="card">
<h3 style="color:var(--sand);margin-bottom:8px">长线</h3>
<h4 style="font-size:22px;margin-bottom:16px">沙漠治理</h4>
<p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-muted);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:16px">岩棉固沙、保水、改良土壤的长期探索，布局荒漠化治理前沿。</p>
</article>
<article class="card">
